Follow the topics and companies you care about. Your feed is built around y=
our interests.
=E2=86=92
Import your stack.
Connect GitHub, Hugging Face, and X to get recommendations based on what yo=
u actually work on.
And that's just the website.
TRY IT HERE
We're also launching a fully personalized newsletter.
Until today, all 350,000 subscribers received the same newsletter.
With Newsletter Pro, no two newsletters are the same.
You choose the topics, companies, and content you care about.
AlphaSignal learns from what you read and what you skip, both in your inbox=
 and on the website. It gives more weight to your recent interests and adap=
ts as your work changes.
So instead of five articles covering the same announcement, you get the few=
 updates that actually deserve your attention.
Your newsletter. Your interests. Your schedule.
